- InterDance (KfkmwYQXWh): Scores 5, 5, 6, 6, 6 — Reject
- Human Motion Diffusion as a Generative Prior (dTpbEdN9kr): Scores 6, 6, 6, 6 — Accept (poster)
- MMG-VL (B5AN6IRyXc): Scores 6, 3, 3, 5, 3 — Withdrawn

