1. **Visualize robustness under systematic joint corruption.** Show reconstructed 3D poses when specific joints are removed or displaced (e.g., 10-50% joint noise), directly comparing G-SFormer against baselines. This is the only way to expose whether the claimed robustness is real or cherry-picked.

